							},
							"string" : "This page contains snippets you can try out. ImageMap draws the inside of the running image as block maps: one block is one object (or one page of objects), and its colour is the kind of object. The snippets read the image you are running, so the numbers differ from machine to machine, and object indexes and offsets change whenever the garbage collector runs."
						}
