								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "{{gtClass:name=ImageMapSnapshot}} takes consecutive objects, in the order `SystemNavigation>>allObjectsDo:` visits them: here 1024 objects from index 5,000,000. Its Map view shows them 16 per row, and the label at the start of each row is the running byte offset. Hover a block to see its object and click to select it; Inspect opens the selected object. Prev, Next, the start-index field and the position bar move the window. On a small image, use a smaller index."
						},
