							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "- `class`: classes and metaclasses\n- `method`: compiled methods and compiled blocks\n- `symbol`: symbols\n- `string`: other strings\n- `array`: other objects with indexed pointer slots, such as an `Array`\n- `methoddict`, `dictionary`, `association`, `ordered`: a `MethodDictionary`, a `Dictionary`, an `Association`, an `OrderedCollection` (and their subclasses)\n- `object`: ordinary objects with named slots only\n- `bytes`, `words`: objects with indexed byte or word slots, such as a `ByteArray`\n- `weak`: weak objects, such as a `WeakArray`\n- `context`: stack contexts\n- `block`: block closures"
						}
					]
				},
