							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "{{gtClass:name=ImageMapOverview}} shows every object. `ImageMapOverview scan` collects garbage first and then walks the heap once, which takes a few seconds. One block is one page of about 1 MiB of live objects, coloured by the kind that takes the most bytes. Click a block for the details of its page, and Open window here to open a window at the start of the page. The page remembers its first object weakly, so after a garbage collection the window still opens at that object."
						},
